abstract: >-
  PACE Controller is a cross-platform graphical interface for classic Druck
  PACE 5000 and PACE 6000 pressure controllers connected through Ethernet or
  RS-232. It provides telemetry, target and slew control, programmable
  routines, source-margin protection, and pressure-loss monitoring.
